{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794373049971,"sessionID":"ses_e370b5ae4ffe9rbeud9vtYO6Dm","part":{"id":"prt_1c8f7de52001OaV5bNrVElBb7m","messageID":"msg_1c8f7cc990015EqKovv63QPoCy","sessionID":"ses_e370b5ae4ffe9rbeud9vtYO6Dm","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794373049972,"sessionID":"ses_e370b5ae4ffe9rbeud9vtYO6Dm","part":{"id":"prt_1c8f7de55001YuIUnY8S6ir8Rl","messageID":"msg_1c8f7cc990015EqKovv63QPoCy","sessionID":"ses_e370b5ae4ffe9rbeud9vtYO6Dm","type":"text","text":"<think>Now components: TimeAgo, SensorCard, LineChart, Layout/Header, and shared form bits.\n\nformat.ts helpers: timeAgo, formatTimestamp, formatValue.\n\nLet me create src/format.ts:\n\n```ts\nexport function timeAgo(iso: string | null): string\nexport function formatTimestamp(iso: string): string  // e.g. \"11 Nov 2026, 04:55\"\nexport function formatValue(value: number | null, unit: string): string\n```\n\nLineChart component in src/components/LineChart.tsx.\n\nLet me write them.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794373049941,"end":1794373049961}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794373049972,"sessionID":"ses_e370b5ae4ffe9rbeud9vtYO6Dm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a1c8f7d4417271b84a50d9","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"export function timeAgo(iso: string | null | undefined): string {\n  if (!iso) return \"never\";\n  const then = new Date(iso).getTime();\n  if (Number.isNaN(then)) return \"unknown\";\n  const seconds = Math.max(0, Math.round((Date.now() - then) / 1000));\n  if (seconds < 5) return \"just now\";\n  if (seconds < 60) return `${seconds}s ago`;\n  const minutes = Math.floor(seconds / 60);\n  if (minutes < 60) return `${minutes}m ago`;\n  const hours = Math.floor(minutes / 60);\n  if (hours < 24) return `${hours}h ago`;\n  const days = Math.floor(hours / 24);\n  if (days < 30) return `${days}d ago`;\n  const months = Math.floor(days / 30);\n  return `${months}mo ago`;\n}\n\nexport function formatTimestamp(iso: string | null | undefined): string {\n  if (!iso) return \"—\";\n  const date = new Date(iso);\n  if (Number.isNaN(date.getTime())) return \"—\";\n  return date.toLocaleString(undefined, {\n    year: \"numeric\",\n    month: \"short\",\n    day: \"2-digit\",\n    hour: \"2-digit\",\n    minute: \"2-digit\",\n    second: \"2-digit\",\n  });\n}\n\nexport function formatClock(iso: string | null | undefined): string {\n  if (!iso) return \"—\";\n  const date = new Date(iso);\n  if (Number.isNaN(date.getTime())) return \"—\";\n  return date.toLocaleTimeString(undefined, { hour: \"2-digit\", minute: \"2-digit\" });\n}\n\nexport function formatValue(value: number | null | undefined, unit?: string): string {\n  if (value === null || value === undefined) return \"—\";\n  const rounded = Math.round(value * 1000) / 1000;\n  return unit ? `${rounded} ${unit}` : String(rounded);\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/format.ts"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/format.ts","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/format.ts","time":{"start":1794373049949,"end":1794373049967}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c8f7de570017r3CwPHXuREvDg","sessionID":"ses_e370b5ae4ffe9rbeud9vtYO6Dm","messageID":"msg_1c8f7cc990015EqKovv63QPoCy"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794373050006,"sessionID":"ses_e370b5ae4ffe9rbeud9vtYO6Dm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a1c8f7d99873bea89e1bc3","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { timeAgo } from \"../format\";\n\nexport default function TimeAgo({\n  iso,\n  className = \"\",\n}: {\n  iso: string | null | undefined;\n  className?: string;\n}) {\n  const [, setTick] = useState(0);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const timer = window.setInterval(() => setTick((value) => value + 1), 1000);\n    return () => window.clearInterval(timer);\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <span className={className} title={iso ?? \"no readings yet\"}>\n      {timeAgo(iso)}\n    </span>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/TimeAgo.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/TimeAgo.tsx","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/components/TimeAgo.tsx","time":{"start":1794373049957,"end":1794373049987}},"id":"prt_1c8f7de60001nAvvKVS4HjxYLR","sessionID":"ses_e370b5ae4ffe9rbeud9vtYO6Dm","messageID":"msg_1c8f7cc990015EqKovv63QPoCy"}}
