{"type":"text","timestamp":1794373143426,"sessionID":"ses_e370b5ae4ffe9rbeud9vtYO6Dm","part":{"id":"prt_1c8f94b6f001GSqoCh0mnzOF28","messageID":"msg_1c8f93ea8001FWCKd1OtrshV3h","sessionID":"ses_e370b5ae4ffe9rbeud9vtYO6Dm","type":"text","text":"<think>Type checking passes. Let me add the \"typecheck\" script to package.json and also consider adding \"preview\". Let me update package.json scripts.\n\nAlso I should double check the `vite.config.ts` is included in tsconfig with \"types\": [\"vite/client\"] — vite.config.ts imports from \"vite\" which is fine.\n\nLet me update package.json scripts:\n```json\n\"scripts\": {\n  \"dev\": \"vite\",\n  \"build\": \"vite build\",\n  \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n  \"preview\": \"vite preview\"\n}\n```\n\nThen verify the whole app by running the Flask server with the built frontend and testing with curl (including the HTML page and asset serving).\n\nThen run a browser test? No browser available probably. Let me at least check the rendered HTML and check that the JS bundle references work.\n\nLet me update package.json.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794373143407,"end":1794373143422}}}
